---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Writing
description: Handwritten essays and notes by Sriram Bharadwaj on art, the absurd, and AI.
permalink: /writing.html
---
{% import "partials/macros.njk" as ui with context %}
<main id="main" class="wrap">
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>Writing</h1>
    <p>I write most of these by hand, in one sitting. Each handwritten piece comes with a typed transcript.</p>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Handwritten</h2>
    {% for post in collections.writing %}{% if post.data.handwritten %}{{ ui.postCard(post, true) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="label">Typed</h2>
    {% for post in collections.writing %}{% if not post.data.handwritten %}{{ ui.postCard(post) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </section>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
    <p>Shorter notes go to Substack first.</p>
    <div class="buttons"><a class="primary" href="{{ site.links.substack }}">Substack</a></div>
  </div>
</main>
